Package: jarvis-settings
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Muhammad AbdElHay <mmAbdelhay@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: jarvis-helper (= @VERSION@), brightnessctl, wireplumber, wlsunset, bluez, power-profiles-daemon, wlr-randr, network-manager, udisks2, rfkill
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: @HOME_URL@
Description: @DISTRO_NAME@ settings tools (MCP server)
 Brightness, volume, night light, Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, audio output, power
 profile, display scale and keyboard layout for the Jarvis agent, plus user
 accounts and removable drives. Reversible changes return the previous value; non-undoable actions return
 undo: null.
